{
  "startedAt": "2026-10-11T13:48:07.355Z",
  "steps": [
    "Actual eleven-module, twenty-seven-capability runtime mounts the independent environment form. WebGL2 software/hardware identity is recorded. A real temporary orbit changes GPU pixels but does not populate the author-camera form or alter source. Unchanged explicit background cannot authorize Apply.",
    "Near 2000 and far 3000 are reviewed atomically even though the original far plane was 1000. The candidate is valid without an intermediate invalid clip pair; Cancel preserves original draft and disk. No claim is made that this distant clipping candidate renders visible objects.",
    "Eight explicit groups review mixed background, camera position/target/FOV/atomic clipping and light direction/color/energy. Complete native BOM/CRLF source preserves objects and other declarations. Chinese/English/Japanese at 390 px retain raw fields and approval, with reachable footer and no horizontal overflow. Cancel writes neither draft nor disk.",
    "Exact current-token Apply changes only the unsaved editor memory. A fresh readonly WebGL2 preview renders the authored environment with different pixels. Ordinary Save writes the complete reviewed BOM/CRLF source; reopening reads the saved camera and clip declarations.",
    "Real native semantic review rejects coincident camera/target, reversed clipping and zero light direction while retaining drafts. Zero light energy is valid and reviewable independently; cancellation leaves source and disk unchanged.",
    "Actual raw-source edits after approval revoke source ownership. Silent checkbox, numeric and color mutations each revoke the form signature and cannot reuse approval or overwrite newer author bytes.",
    "Environment Apply retains the ordinary Save precondition. A real external saved-file change triggers the existing conflict dialog; Cancel preserves both external disk bytes and the reviewed unsaved environment draft.",
    "With WebGL2 alone explicitly injected unavailable, the readonly preview reports that no image was drawn while real native environment review remains available. The form has no renderer, backend, World or Save authority."
  ],
